{"unit_id":"inmny__dsh-continue#card-zh","repo":"inmny/dsh-continue","commit":"24264bc610d17f64563d85a6ecc0f7ac6fef11ce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-continue 是面向 DSH Web 的会话续跑插件，在对话输入框旁提供继续运行按钮。它通过读取最近的会话边界判断任务是否因请求错误、中断或输出上限等原因结束，并让用户从原有上下文继续，不额外插入提示词。插件也支持符合条件的子代理续跑，并在输入待处理、会话运行中或状态变化时隐藏或拒绝操作。适合需要恢复异常 DSH 会话的 Web 用户；需要 DSH Web 与 Node.js 24 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:122-170","client.js:198-269","src/runtime.ts:634-649","src/runtime.ts:1461-1554"]}
{"unit_id":"inmny__dsh-continue#card-en","repo":"inmny/dsh-continue","commit":"24264bc610d17f64563d85a6ecc0f7ac6fef11ce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-continue adds a button to DSH Web that resumes an interrupted or failed session from its existing context, without a new prompt. It supports eligible subagents and hides the button when input is pending or the session is running. For DSH Web users; requires Node.js 24 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:122-170","client.js:198-269","src/runtime.ts:634-649","src/runtime.ts:1461-1554"]}
