{"unit_id":"inmny__dsh-continue#feature-3","repo":"inmny/dsh-continue","commit":"24264bc610d17f64563d85a6ecc0f7ac6fef11ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-continue 的功能「subagent」：符合 continuable 模式且父会话在线的子代理可单独续跑；运行时会检查目标状态，并限制同一父会话同时处理多个续跑请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/runtime.ts:1505-1516"]}
